  "reflectionText": "While Babylon held Anathoth, Jeremiah bought a field he could not walk to, sealed the deeds in an earthen vessel, and said: houses and fields shall yet again be bought in this land. What is it to buy a field whose roads are closed, and to seal the deed in an earthen vessel against the day when the roads will be open again?"
